    skos:prefLabel "cultural ecosystem services"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15113> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/13302> ;
    skos:definition "The use of less resources per unit of economic output and reducing the environmental impact of any resources that are used or economic activities that are undertaken"@en ;
