        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2926> ;
    skos:definition "detailed statistics for better management of the economy, like accounts for the sectoral inputs of water and energy and outputs of pollution needed to model green growth scenarios."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "natural capital accounts"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15245> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15201>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/7822> ;
    skos:definition "factors such as wealth, health and employment, which are associated with a good life"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "objective well-being"@en ;
    skos:related <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15201> .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15249> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/5500> ;
    skos:definition "Stoff, der kohlenstoffhaltige Substanzen enthält und entwickelt wurde, um den Anteil an organischer Bodensubstanz zu erhöhen"@de,
        "substance containing carbonaceous materials designed to increase the content of organic matter in soil"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "organisches Bodenverbesserungsmittel"@de,
        "organic soil improver"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Improved definition (EN only): improver containing carbonaceous materials whose main function is to increase soil organic matter content"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15251> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/13088>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15250> ;
    skos:definition "allgemeine Methode zur Messung und Offenlegung der möglichen Umweltauswirkungen einer Organisation während des Lebenszyklus"@de,
        "general method to measure and communicate the potential life cycle environmental impact of an organisation"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Methode für die Berechnung des Umweltfußabdrucks von Organisationen"@de,
        "organisation environmental footprint method"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Improved definition (EN only): General method to measure and communicate the potential life cycle environmental impact of an organisation as laid down in Annex III of the Recommendation (2013/179/EU). It provides a quantified measurement of the potential environmental performance taking all relevant life cycle stages of an organization into account, from a supply chain perspective."@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15256> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/5991> ;
    skos:definition "Substances which contribute to the formation of ground-level ozone"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "ozone precursor"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15257> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2947> ;
    skos:definition "epidemic so widely spread that vast numbers of people in different countries are affected"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "pandemics"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15258> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/9051> ;
    skos:definition "biologisch abbaubare Grünabfälle aus Parks und Gärten, einschließlich Wasser und Holz (Lignozellulose, Grasschnitt, Baum- und Strauchabfälle, Blätter, Blüten)"@de,
        "biodegradable green waste from parks, gardens including water and wood (lignocellulosis, grass clippings, bush and tree cuttings, leaves, flowers)"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Parkabfälle"@de,
        "park waste"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1526> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/7402> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00015346> ;
    skos:definition "Coastal waters are typically characterized by a shallow continental shelf, gently sloping seaward to a continental slope, which drops relatively abruptly to the deep ocean. The proximity of coastal water to land also influences the water circulation. In the vicinity of freshwater inflows, the nearshore circulation is altered by the presence of density-driven motions. Coastal waters are under enormous environmental stress, caused by a wide range of factors including pollution and the destruction and deterioration of marine habitats."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://aims.fao.org/aos/agrovoc/c_25205>,
        <http://eurovoc.europa.eu/611> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Küstengewässer"@de,
        "coastal water"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15268> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/13088>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15250>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15267> ;
    skos:definition "allgemeine Methode zur Messung und Offenlegung der möglichen Umweltauswirkungen des Lebenszyklus eines Produktes"@de,
        "general method to measure and communicate the potential environmental impact of the lifecycle of a product"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Methode für die Berechnung des Umweltfußabdrucks von Produkten"@de,
        "product environmental footprint method"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Improved definition (EN only): General method to measure and communicate the potential life cycle environmental impact of a product as laid down in Annex II of the Recommendation (2013/179/EU). It provides a quantified measurement of the potential environmental performance taking all relevant life cycle stages of a product into account, from a supply chain perspective."@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1527> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4635> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00049784> ;
    skos:definition "The objective of coastal management and planning is the preservation of coastal resources whilst simultaneously satisfying the sometimes conflicting interests and requirements of protection, development, usage and conservation."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Küstengebietsplanung"@de,
        "coastal zone planning"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1528> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/558> ;
    skos:definition "A maritime force which aids shipping, saves lives at sea, prevents smuggling, etc. It also responds to emergencies involving oil spills and other discharges at sea and takes the lead in enforcing the law, including assessing penalties for environmental violations."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Küstenwacht"@de,
        "coastguard"@en ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Coast_guard> .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15287> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/12011>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15077> ;
    skos:definition "any liquid fuel which is derived by or from qualified feedstocks and meets the registration requirements for fuels and fuel additives"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "second generation biofuel production"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1530> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4260> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00028898>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Coating> ;
    skos:definition "A material applied onto or impregnated into a substrate for protective, decorative, or functional purposes. Such materials include, but are not limited to, paints, varnishes, sealers, adhesives, thinners, diluents, and inks."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://aims.fao.org/aos/agrovoc/c_1701> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Beschichtung"@de,
        "coating"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3081> ;
    skos:definition "natural and irrevocable process leading to the death of a species without leaving any progeny and causing complete loss of genetic diversity"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "species extinction"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15304> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3238> ;
    skos:definition "sustainable exploitation of the fisheries stock wich will not prejudice the future exploitation or the marine eco-systems"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "sustainable fisheries"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15308> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15279>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8250> ;
    skos:definition "use of natural resources in a way and at a rate that does not lead to the long-term decline of biological diversity, thereby maintaining its potential to meet the needs and aspirations of present and future generations"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "sustainable resource use"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15310> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/12011>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15077> ;
    skos:definition "treatment of animal by-products under the following conditions"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "thermo-mechanical biofuel production"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15312> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8229> ;
    skos:definition "Gewässer zwischen Land und Meer, einschließlich Fjorden, Mündungsgebieten, Lagunen, Deltas und Rias"@de,
        "waters between the land and sea, including fjords, estuaries, lagoons, deltas and rias"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Übergangsgewässer"@de,
        "transitional waters"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Improved definition (EN only): bodies of surface water in the vicinity of river mouths which are partly saline in character as a result of their proximity to coastal waters but which are substantially influnced by freshwater flows"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15314> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/157> ;
    skos:definition "composed of various chemical species"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "troposheric aerosol"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15315> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2525> ;
    skos:definition "habitats of underground living species buffered from profound climatic modifications and thus retaining a broad diversity of living relicts, the great majority of which being represented by terrestrial, troglobitic species, with a reduced mobility"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "underground ecosystem"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1533> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/5945> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00031527>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cockroach> ;
    skos:definition "The most primitive of the living winged insects. It is thought they have been unchanged for more than 300 million years, and are among the oldest fossil insects. Cockroaches are usually found in tropical climates, but a few species, out of the total 3.500 known species, have become pests. They are common household pests in many countries, imported by ship and carried home in grocery bags. Cockroaches eat plant and animal products, including food, paper, clothing and soiled hospital waste, fouling everything they touch with their droppings and unpleasant odour, to which many people are allergic. They are a major health hazard and carry harmful bacteria, protozoan parasites and faunal pathogens, including those that cause typhoid, leprosy and salmonella. Conventional insecticides make little or no impact on the cockroaches population."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Schabe"@de,
        "cockroach"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15336> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4873> ;
    skos:definition "The global capacity of ecosystems to regenerate what people demand from those surfarces"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "world biocapacity"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15337> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8776> ;
    skos:definition "international organisation, directing and coordinating authority for health within the United Nations which supports member states in coordinating funds, foundations, civil society organisations and the private sector to meet health objectives and support national health policies and strategies"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "World Health Organization"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15342> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/9051> ;
    skos:definition "Abfall, der in Haushalten ausschließlich aus Wohnzwecken entsteht und der als normaler gemischter Haushaltsabfall entsorgt wird"@de,
        "waste from accommodation used purely for living purposes and which is disposed of via the normal mixed domestic refuse collection"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Hausmüll"@de,
        "household waste"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15343> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/7761> ;
    skos:definition "Luftverunreinigung durch eine Reihe gesundheitsschädigender Schadstoffe, wie feine Partikel und Kohlenstoffmonoxid (CO) sowie partikelförmige Schadstoffe, deren Wert um ein Vielfaches höher sein kann als die akzeptierten Richtwerte für Innenräume"@de,
        "air pollution that contains a range of health-damaging pollutants, such as small particles and carbon monoxide (CO), and levels of particulate pollutants that can many times be higher than accepted guideline values for indoor spaces"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Rauch in Innenräumen"@de,
        "indoor smoke"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15344> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2422> ;
    skos:definition "Richtlinie zur Schaffung einer Geodateninfrastruktur in Europa für die Unterstützung einer gemeinschaftlichen Umweltpolitik sowie anderer politischer Maßnahmen oder sonstiger Tätigkeiten, die Auswirkungen auf die Umwelt haben können"@de,
        "Directive establishing an infrastructure for spatial information in Europe to support Community environmental policies and policies or activities which may have an impact on the environment."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "INSPIRE"@de,
        "INSPIRE"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15346> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15345> ;
    skos:definition "Abfälle, die auf einer Abfalldeponie gelagert werden, die entsprechend dem Europäischen Abfallkatalog beschrieben sind und zu den bereits bestehenden Abfalldeponien hinzugefügt werden, und die aus Gewerbe, Industrie und Haushalt stammen, wobei Bestandteile ausgenommen sind, die bereits für Wiederverwendung, Recycling oder Verbrennung eingesammelt wurden"@de,
        "waste which is deposited in landfill, characterised according to the European Waste Catalogue, and which adds to the inventory of landfill already in place,  covering commercial, industrial and household sources, and excluding fractions already recovered for re-use, recycling or incineration"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Abfallströme auf Deponien"@de,
        "landfill waste flows"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15347> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/9127> ;
    skos:definition "organisches, biologisch abbaubares Abwasser, das organische Schadstoffe enthält, z. B. Kanalisationswasser oder industrielles Abwasser"@de,
        "organic biodegradable wastewater containing organic pollutants, such as sewage, industrial wastewater and the like"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "organisches Abwasser"@de,
        "organic wastewater"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15348> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/6370> ;
    skos:definition "Einsatz bestimmter politischer Instrumente, um die Wahrscheinlichkeit zu erhöhen, dass das festgelegte politische Ziel erreicht wird"@de,
        "use of particular policy instruments, in such a way as to increase the chance to achieve the defined policy target"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Wirksamkeit politischer Maßnahmen"@de,
        "policy effectiveness"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15349> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8366> ;
    skos:definition "Veränderung der globalen Durchschnittstemperatur, die zum Klimawandel führen kann"@de,
        "change to the global average temperature that can lead to climate change"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Temperaturveränderung"@de,
        "temperature change"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15350> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15182> ;
    skos:definition "tertiäre Minderungstechnik, die für Großfeuerungsanlagen, z. B. Kraftwerke, konzipiert ist"@de,
        "abatement end-of-pipe technology, which is fitted to large combustion plants such as power plants"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Rauchgasentschwefelung"@de,
        "flue gas desulphurisation"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1541> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broadMatch <http://eurovoc.europa.eu/6023> ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1542> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00020577> ;
    skos:definition "A systematic collection of procedures outlining the established method of application of all relevant laws, rules or regulations to a specific endeavor."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Regel der Technik"@de,
        "code of practice"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1554> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1500> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00014652>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Coke> ;
    skos:definition "A coherent, cellular, solid residue remaining from the dry distillation of a coking coal or of pitch, petroleum, petroleum residue, or other carbonaceous materials; contains carbon as its principal constituent."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://eurovoc.europa.eu/6027> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Koks"@de,
