    skos:prefLabel "Industrielle Entwicklung"@de,
        "industrial development"@en ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Industry> .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4238> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3518> ;
    skos:definition "Any smokelike or vaporous exhalation from matters or substances, especially of an odorous or harmful nature, which result from trading, commercial or manufacturing processes."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
