    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00013559> ;
    skos:definition "Technologies that meet environmental objectives by incorporating pollution prevention concepts in their design. Integrated environmental control strategies introduced in the early design stages of a process, rather than an end-of-pipe control option introduced in the later stages, improve the technical and economic performance of a process."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Integrierte Umweltschutztechnik"@de,
        "integrated environmental protection technology"@en .

