    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00028781> ;
    skos:definition """1) The occurrence of one or more pest species in an area or location where their numbers and impact are currently or potentially at intolerable levels. 
2) A sudden increase in destructiveness or population numbers of a pest species in a given area."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Schädlingsbefall"@de,
