    skos:definition "Obligations, responsibilities or debts imposed upon all members of an industry that manufactures or produces a product or service causing injury or harm to a consumer and apportioned according to each member's share of the market for the product."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://eurovoc.europa.eu/3635> ;
