    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00028041>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Root> ;
    skos:definition "The absorbing and anchoring organ of a vascular plant; it bears neither leaves nor flowers and is usually subterranean."@en ;
