<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/755> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/767> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00031220>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Beaching> ;
    skos:definition "The washing ashore of whales or other cetaceans that have died for natural causes, or because of highly polluted sea water or after being trapped in drift nets."@en ;
