    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00024509>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Titanium> ;
    skos:definition "A strong malleable white metallic element, which is very corrosion-resistant and occurs in rutile and ilmenite. It is used in the manufacture of strong lightweight alloys, especially aircraft parts."@en ;
