    skos:closeMatch <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Urban_ecosystem> ;
    skos:definition "Towns and cities viewed as ecosystems, having an input of matter and energy, recycling within the system, and an output of matter and energy into the surroundings."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Städtisches Ökosystem"@de,
