<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/9209> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/6831> ;
    skos:definition "A machine or apparatus used to lift water, usually from a well or borehole, which is powered manually or by engine, wind or some other source."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
