<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1061> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4321> ;
    skos:definition "Collection of open and/or closed drains, together with structures and pumps used to collect and dispose of excess surface or subsurface water."@en ;
