    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8388> ;
    skos:definition "The interacting system of a biological community and its non-living environmental surroundings located in climatic regions where the air temperature is below 10° Celsius for eight to eleven months of the year."@en ;
