    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00049990> ;
    skos:definition "Remedial and preventive actions adopted against desertification include irrigation, planting of trees and grasses, the erection of fences to secure sand dunes, and a careful management of water resources."@en ;
