    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00009894> ;
    skos:definition "A decline in the productivity of an area of land or in its ability to support natural ecosystems or types of agriculture. Degradation may be caused by a variety of factors, including inappropriate land management techniques, soil erosion, salinity, flooding, clearing, pests, pollution, climatic factors, or progressive urbanization."@en ;
