    skos:related <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/5279> ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Drink> .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/7842> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4302> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00022652> ;
    skos:definition "Software is the general term used to describe all of the various programs that may be used on a computer system. Software can be divided into four main categories: systems software, development software, user interface software, applications software."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://eurovoc.europa.eu/1696> ;
