    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00005121>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Biocoenosis> ;
    skos:definition "A community or natural assemblage of organisms; often used as an alternative to ecosystem but strictly is the fauna/flora association excluding physical aspects of the environment."@en ;
