    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00024766> ;
    skos:definition "A vegetation class consisting of tall, close-growing trees, their columnar trunks more or less unbranched in the lower two-thirds, and forming a spreading and frequently flat crown; occurs in areas of high temperature and high rainfall."@en ;
