    skos:closeMatch <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Waste_minimisation> ;
    skos:definition "Measures or techniques, including plans and directives, that reduce the amount of wastes generated. Examples of waste minimisation are environmentally-sound recycling and source reduction practices."@en ;
