    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/4589> ;
    skos:definition "type of liquid storage system designed and operated to combine waste stabilization and storage with varying lengths of storage (up to a year or greater), depending on the climate region, the volatile solids loading rate, and other operational factors"@en ;
