        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2735> ;
    skos:definition "use of biomass as an energy resource that contributes to climate change mitigation, energy security, and economic development goals, results in minimal environmental and social impacts, and attains economic self-sufficiency"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
