<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2291> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/450> ;
    skos:definition "1) Wild animal which has been trained to live near a house and not be frightened of human beings; 2) species which was formerly wild, now selectively bred to fill human needs."@en ;
