    skos:definition "An image captured by a camera or some other device and reproduced as a picture, usually on a sensitized surface and formed by the chemical action of light or of radiant energy."@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://eurovoc.europa.eu/3598> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
