<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/206> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/11499> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00001414> ;
    skos:definition "Agricultural law is a blend of traditional fields of law including the law of contracts, bailments, torts, criminal, environmental, property, nuisance, wills and estates, and tax law. As such, it is a gathering of statutory and common law."@en ;
