<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/1307> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/237> ;
    skos:definition "Fertilizer manufactured from chemicals; excessive use of them can cause pollution, when all the chemicals are not taken up by the plants and the excess is leached out of the soil into rivers and may cause algal bloom."@en ;
