<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/13290> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/95> ;
    skos:definition "Any prescribed step or manner of proceeding that a law making body takes in proposing laws, resolutions or special acts before they can be enacted or passed."@en ;
