        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3300>,
        <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3301> ;
    skos:scopeNote "Improved definition (EN only): Preventing damage caused by floods by avoiding construction of houses and industries in present and future flood-prone areas; by adapting future developments to the risk of flooding; and by promoting appropriate land-use, agricultural and forestry practices"@en .

<http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/15175> a skos:Concept ;
