    skos:closeMatch <http://data.uba.de/umt/_00007140>,
        <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dual_economy> ;
    skos:definition "An economy based upon two separate/distinct economic systems which co-exist in the same geographical space. Dualism is characteristic of many developing countries in which some parts of a country resemble advanced economies while other parts resemble traditional economies, i.e. there are circuits of production and exchange."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/gemetThesaurus> ;
